00:59:24,000 --> 00:59:30,000
Cassandra's Dream is a 2007 crime thriller drama film
written and directed by Woody Allen.

12
01:04:48,000 --> 01:04:54,000
It stars Hayley Atwell, Colin Farrell, Sally
Hawkins, Ewan McGregor and Tom Wilkinson.

13
01:10:12,000 --> 01:10:18,000
Shot in England, the film is a co-production between the
United States, France, and the United Kingdom.

14
01:15:36,000 --> 01:15:42,000
The film premiered in secret in Avilés, Spain, on 18 June 2007.

15
01:21:00,000 --> 01:21:06,000
It officially premiered at the 64th Venice International Film Festival on 2
September 2007 and was already in theaters in Spain by 3 November.

16
01:26:24,000 --> 01:26:30,000
The film had its North American premiere at the Toronto
International Film Festival on 11 September 2007.

17
01:31:48,000 --> 01:31:54,000
Cassandra's Dream was released theatrically in France on 31 October 2007, in the United
States on 18 January 2008, and in the United Kingdom on 23 May 2008.

18
01:37:12,000 --> 01:37:18,000
The film explores themes of sailboat, sibling relationship, love
triangle, restart, parent child relationship.

19
01:42:36,000 --> 01:42:42,000
The tone is emotional and intense.
